
# Cloud-Based Data Analytics Dashboard

## Project Objective

The objective of this project is to develop a cloud-based analytics dashboard capable of displaying real-time business insights through interactive visualizations. The system provides revenue tracking, transaction monitoring, and analytics reporting through a modern web interface.

## Technologies Used

### Frontend

* React.js
* Tailwind CSS
* Axios
* Recharts

### Backend

* Node.js
* Express.js
* CORS

### Deployment

* Render (Frontend)
* Render (Backend)

## Project Architecture

User → React Frontend → Express API → Analytics Data

The frontend communicates with the backend API to retrieve analytics information and display it through charts and dashboard cards.

## Features Implemented

* Real-time Analytics Dashboard
* Revenue Visualization Chart
* Transaction Monitoring Table
* Responsive User Interface
* API Integration
* Loading States
* Error Handling
* Cloud Deployment

## Implementation

The frontend was developed using React.js and Tailwind CSS to create a responsive dashboard interface. The backend was developed using Node.js and Express.js to provide analytics data through REST APIs.

Charts were implemented using Recharts to provide interactive visualizations of revenue data. Axios was used to connect the frontend and backend.

## Deployment Process

1. Source code pushed to GitHub.
2. Backend deployed as a Render Web Service.
3. Frontend deployed as a Render Static Site.
4. Environment variables configured.
5. Frontend connected to deployed backend API.
6. Application tested successfully.

## Results

The application successfully displays analytics information through interactive dashboard components. The project demonstrates cloud deployment, frontend-backend integration, and real-time analytics visualization.

## Conclusion

The Cloud-Based Data Analytics Dashboard was successfully developed and deployed. The project provides a scalable foundation for future integration with AWS services such as AWS Kinesis, AWS Lambda, and Amazon Redshift.

## Future Enhancements

* AWS Kinesis Integration
* AWS Lambda Processing
* Amazon Redshift Data Warehouse
* Authentication and Authorization
* Export Reports
* Advanced Analytics and Forecasting
